{"turn_id": "d21-t1", "session_id": "d21", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "num_tv_series", "text": "该研究考虑了3部电视剧，分别是《花千骨》(“The Journey of Flower”)、《琅琊榜》(“Nirvana in Fire”)和《大好时光》(“Good Time”)。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.02378", "chunk_id": "c-4c54b2bdf952cba612027168"}, {"paper_id": "1611.02378", "chunk_id": "c-a65bcd7ea05135dba44f5b2d"}]}, {"key": "tv_series_selection", "text": "作者选择这三部剧作为数据集的一部分，因为它们是2015年夏至秋季最热的电视剧。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.02378", "chunk_id": "c-4c54b2bdf952cba612027168"}]}, {"key": "training_test_split", "text": "为证明分类器的泛化性，实验以其中两部电视剧作为训练数据，其余一部作为测试集。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.02378", "chunk_id": "c-a65bcd7ea05135dba44f5b2d"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d21-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d21-t2", "session_id": "d21", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "tv_series_count", "text": "论文提到三部电视剧：用“1”“2”“3”分别表示《花千骨》（The Journey of Flower）、《琅琊榜》（Nirvana in Fire）和《欢乐颂》（Good Time）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.02378", "chunk_id": "c-a65bcd7ea05135dba44f5b2d"}]}, {"key": "train_test_split_count", "text": "为证明分类器的泛化能力，论文使用其中两部电视剧作为训练数据，其余部分作为测试集。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.02378", "chunk_id": "c-a65bcd7ea05135dba44f5b2d"}]}, {"key": "reviews_per_series", "text": "每部电视剧有 5000 条符合筛选标准的评论。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.02378", "chunk_id": "c-83230732113c4324770750f5"}]}, {"key": "labeling_procedure", "text": "每条电视剧评论至少由两人标注，只有被赋予相同标签的评论才会进入训练和测试数据。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.02378", "chunk_id": "c-83230732113c4324770750f5"}]}, {"key": "category_count", "text": "根据 LDA 的结果，论文定义了八个通用评论类别。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.02378", "chunk_id": "c-83230732113c4324770750f5"}, {"paper_id": "1611.02378", "chunk_id": "c-bc5cf6361e6021a506623c74"}]}, {"key": "hot_series_focus", "text": "论文关注的是中国热门电视剧的评论。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.02378", "chunk_id": "c-73d11df2bfaba0b8419013e4"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d21-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
